{ "timestamp":"2025-12-12T20:39:08Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"t4yqp", "Message":"oh, no worries at all.  I was replying to your greeting, afterall.  I also never expect responses when I call out o7, 'cuz I know evy1's usually paying attention to other things.", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-12-12T20:39:38Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"fhu3g", "Message":":D true", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-12-12T20:39:57Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"t4yqp", "Message":"that said, AA channel seems to have been very quiet these last few weeks.", "Channel":"squadron" }
