{ "timestamp":"2025-12-12T20:42:00Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"t4yqp", "Message":"I'm out doing some engineering chores... but want to know if anyone is reinforcing the fortified system near HIP 87621 (blue trees)?  It's being undermined, and I want to help, but I'm a bit ignorant about PP2.  Any advice for me?", "Channel":"squadron" }
